<h1>Rent due for SS Hall</h1>
<p>Hi <%= @full_name %>,</p>
<p>
  Thank you for continuing to stay in the hostel. Your rent is due soon: your current tenancy expires on <strong><%= @tenancy_end_date %></strong>.
  Please start preparing to pay before then.
</p>
<p>
  If paying on time is going to be an issue, or you don't wish to renew your tenancy, please let us know by email.
</p>
<%= render "payment_details" %>
<p>You can check your tenancy at any time at <%= link_to root_url, root_url %>.</p>
<%= render "signature" %>
